{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat monsters and climb the floors!\u00a0</strong><i>Carteado</i> is a casual top-down roguelite where you use your cards to defeat monsters while building your deck and unlocking new ones!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/d291f2d5d2ffc1e8bd3faa40a7f574de.poster.avif?t=1758572639\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/d291f2d5d2ffc1e8bd3faa40a7f574de.webm?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/d291f2d5d2ffc1e8bd3faa40a7f574de.mp4?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into this procedural dungeon</strong>, where each floor you reach grows larger and enemies become stronger. Find items and cards to aid you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/88c977400a778e0c2ef5ba07b27747ff.poster.avif?t=1758572639\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/88c977400a778e0c2ef5ba07b27747ff.webm?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/88c977400a778e0c2ef5ba07b27747ff.mp4?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect cards with different powers</strong> throughout your adventure to craft your deck and overcome monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/73747816a26a7262144a1ba53384a887.poster.avif?t=1758572639\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/73747816a26a7262144a1ba53384a887.webm?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/73747816a26a7262144a1ba53384a887.mp4?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face monsters to earn chips during your run</strong>. Use them to buy items that boost your stats or upgrade your deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/5fa034f1db7d1fe40ed520f0a836d595.poster.avif?t=1758572639\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/5fa034f1db7d1fe40ed520f0a836d595.webm?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/5fa034f1db7d1fe40ed520f0a836d595.mp4?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover over 20 unique cards</strong>, complete challenges, and unlock even more to support you in your adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock new perks</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/83eab01a5d11ae42267d82c92cb1b673.poster.avif?t=1758572639\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/83eab01a5d11ae42267d82c92cb1b673.webm?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/83eab01a5d11ae42267d82c92cb1b673.mp4?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb higher floors to unlock powerful perks</strong>\u2014over 15 are available\u2014to help in your future explorations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Be stylish!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/6cd1807f056df5feb5c36430c250958d.poster.avif?t=1758572639\" width=600 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/6cd1807f056df5feb5c36430c250958d.webm?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/extras/6cd1807f056df5feb5c36430c250958d.mp4?t=1758572639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some achievements unlock new looks to look awesome while exploring.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3863510?t=1758572639","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/1320caa44b3c92eb26d17840a513d82f1da9bb7d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758572639","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3863510/f75e74ffb157f4f0b03ccbc945b25ec16a8ddbb2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758572639","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.stea